# Shared secret the ESP sends as "Authorization: Bearer <key>". At least 16 characters, e.g. the output of
# "openssl rand -hex 24". docker compose does not start with it empty; the server refuses every request
# with a shorter key or the old example value.
# The same value goes into the ESP's settings (home page > gear > History server).
TONEPIE_API_KEY=
TONEPIE_TZ=Europe/Rome
